```
:::
:::


Scikit-Learn orders the matrix as:

\[
\begin{bmatrix}
TN & FP \\
FN & TP
\end{bmatrix}.
\]

The four counts can be extracted directly.

::: {#unpack-confusion-matrix .cell execution_count=17}
``` {.python .cell-code}
