# ROC curves and ROC AUC

## True positive and false positive rates

The **receiver operating characteristic (ROC) curve** plots:

- the true positive rate, which is the same as recall;
- the false positive rate, defined as

\[
\text{FPR}
=
\frac{FP}{FP+TN}
=
1-\text{Specificity}.
\]

::: {#compute-roc .cell execution_count=31}
